You can also adjust the camera's [System:Color name=tutorial ]height and zoom[/System:Color].
[System:Color name=tutorial ]Hold down [ML:icon icon=L ] and move [ML:icon icon=R3 ] left and right[/System:Color] to adjust camera height;
[System:Color name=tutorial ]hold down [ML:icon icon=L ] and move [ML:icon icon=R3 ] up and down[/System:Color] to adjust zoom.

Kagutsuchi's Supporter Arts lower enemy physical defense;
Wadatsumi's Supporter Arts support the Attacker.
[System:Color name=tutorial ]Switch Blades to suit the situation[/System:Color].
